---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const today = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  day: 'numeric'
});
---

<Base title="kiran haber :: now">
  <div class="content">
    <p>
      I'm currently interning at the Multiscale Ocean Dynamics lab within the Scripps Institution of Oceanography at UCSD.
      So far, I've helped test a new transceiver and built a voltage/current measurement module that could be integrated into a "switch"
      for autonomous sensor power management onboard underwater ocean profilers (basically, waking up sensors when the time 
      is right to record data). As of now, I'm working on an RTK-enabled GPS wave buoy, which just had a successful ocean deployment! I'm
      now cleaning things up and improving its documentation for my professor's graduate class next quarter.
      My favorite thing about my time at Scripps up to this point is the opportunities I get to branch out of just writing code
       and develop my electrical and mechanical engineering skills.
    </p>
    
    <p>
      <b>Consuming:</b> <i>Computer System Architecture</i> by M. Morris Mano, Autechre, Yung Lean, Bladee,
      Vinland Saga
    </p>

    <div class="meta">Updated {today}</div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .content {
    padding: 40px;
    max-width: 600px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .meta {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
